    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34278" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπείρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fix on</i> or <i>in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥλους ἐκπώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					11.488d
				</span></i>
			(
				Pass.
			); [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρατος] ἐμπαρέντος ταῖς πύλαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.298a
				</span></i>
			; of fish bones in the throat, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				8.53
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπεπαρμένος πόνος</span>
			<i>fixed</i> pain, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.91
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>impale</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἐμπαρείη ταῖς ἑαυτοῦ λόγχαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					16.10.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥλοις ἐμπεπαρμένη βακτηρία</span>
			<i>studded</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴ τοῖς ἀλόγοις πάθεσιν ἑαυτὴν
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Epict.</u>
				p.125D.
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, ibid.</div>
